{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15107030","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15107030","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510702001:":{"text":"Wait, that's an army. Where are they headed?","source_cn":"军队？他们要去哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x528954AF70A4EB2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510702002:":{"text":"I, Lygos, shall lead the charge!","source_cn":"副将隆尔领命出兵——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFD19CB3E50D2C5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510702003:":{"text":"We take the fight to those savages in Wrathwood Grove!","source_cn":"讨伐兽人，占领树怒山谷！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61207543342CFF7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510702004:":{"text":"Kill 'em all!","source_cn":"杀光他们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB70AF4605A7D7545","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510702005:":{"text":"You must return victorious!","source_cn":"一定要凯旋啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75B7F1E6B3BA952A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510702006:":{"text":"Avenge the fallen!","source_cn":"替死去的人报仇！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BACCDE1AF9BC25C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510703001:0":{"text":"They're attacking Wrathwood Grove...?!","source_cn":"他们要进攻树怒山谷……？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDEC581FE168B47A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510703002:0":{"text":"Who knows? Maybe the young Regulus is looking for a quick victory.","source_cn":"谁知道呢？可能那位年轻的领主想速战速决？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF08D180B3B1072C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510703003:0":{"text":"Abundius may be the Regulus, but his powers are kept in check by the councilors and various nobles. He can't just do as he pleases.","source_cn":"阿邦德虽是领主，但他的命令被议事官与诸多贵族掣肘，各方...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC77C5601BF89F25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510703004:0":{"text":"Especially after the flood. To mobilize an army when people are this unsettled... he'd need an airtight reason to avoid being accused of sending his people to their deaths.","source_cn":"尤其是在洪水之后。在人心动荡时出兵，要想不被指控枉顾人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x387609115FECF285","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1510703001":{"text":"They're attacking Wrathwood Grove...?!","source_cn":"他们要进攻树怒山谷……？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDEC581FE168B47A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510703005:0":{"text":"This is a huge military procession, but the general isn't with them... Something's very wrong here.","source_cn":"军队出征声势浩大，统帅却不在队伍里……这太反常了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD1B7EDF23B0BDC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510703006:0":{"text":"The Halians are definitely up to something.","source_cn":"呼临人一定有别的计谋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F4388DE4A327D12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510703007:0":{"text":"We need to find him. We can't let the Halians get away with whatever they're planning!","source_cn":"得找到他。无论呼临人想做什么，都不能让他们得逞！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D3B76BABF22BDA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"I don't see Perseus.","source_cn":"没看到珀尔修斯","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDFD6C5843D0DA949","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I don't see Perseus.","female":"I don't see Perseus.","variant_male_record_index":"77134","variant_female_record_index":"77135","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510703008:0":{"text":"... He's gone.","source_cn":"……他消失了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEE9618F352E7AC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1510703009:0":{"text":"The connection I had with my tracking spear was cut off the moment I entered Halia.","source_cn":"来到呼临城以后，我和追踪矛之间的感应就中断了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB21A59E3ADEFA6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1510703010:0":{"text":"It's quite simple for a god to block your tracking, even if your powers came from the Hunting God.","source_cn":"对一位神明来说，想要切断你的追踪并不困难，即便那是狩猎...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9C34B753A8FD8961","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"It's quite simple for a god to block your tracking, even if your powers came from the Hunting God.","female":"It's quite simple for a god to block your tracking, even if your powers came from the Hunting Goddess.","variant_male_record_index":"181446","variant_female_record_index":"181447","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"The God of Harvest doesn't seem to be here.","source_cn":"丰饶神好像不在这里","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7F196876ED5A5123","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The God of Harvest doesn't seem to be here.","female":"The God of Harvest doesn't seem to be here.","variant_male_record_index":"77136","variant_female_record_index":"77137","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1510703011:0":{"text":"But... What about Wrathwood Grove?","source_cn":"但，树怒山谷的安危……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x994A78FF390D620D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1510703012:0":{"text":"It takes time to move an army. They need to march to Mirehold first, which is some distance from Halia. The threat to Wrathwood Grove isn't imminent, there's no need to be so worried.","source_cn":"行军需要时间，水泽营地距离呼临城尚有一段距离，树怒山谷...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10EDD3E2F87A1E95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1510703013:0":{"text":"If it comes down to it, I'll use my teleportation magic to get us back to Wrathwood Grove. We still have some time, so we should investigate why this Halian army is even marching out.","source_cn":"必要时，我会用传送魔法带你们立刻返回树怒山谷支援。趁现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA66F8AE2CFE3D310","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1510703014:0":{"text":"I have a feeling... the reason is probably linked to the God of Harvest.","source_cn":"我有一种预感……他们出征的缘由很可能与丰饶神有关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09D5F639687A0AEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:2:3":{"text":"We need to investigate first.","source_cn":"疑点太多，先调查清楚","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD39C854B5D8FC515","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We need to investigate first.","female":"We need to investigate first.","variant_male_record_index":"77138","variant_female_record_index":"77139","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:29:15010712:0":{"text":"Along the way, you hear that Lygos is preparing to lead his troops against Wrathwood Grove. The people fervently cheer them on as they set out.","source_cn":"路上，你们听闻副将隆尔即将领兵攻打树怒山谷，声势浩大，...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x258F88B863DC8478","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Along the way, you hear that Lygos is preparing to lead his troops against Wrathwood Grove. The people fervently cheer them on as they set out.","female":"Along the way, you hear that Lygos is preparing to lead his troops against Wrathwood Grove. The people fervently cheer them on as they set out.","variant_male_record_index":"193671","variant_female_record_index":"193672","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:加拉":{"text":"Gala","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:副将隆尔":{"text":"Lieutenant Lygos","source":"副将隆尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:送行的群众A":{"text":"送行的群众A","source":"送行的群众A","status":"source"},"speaker:送行的群众B":{"text":"送行的群众B","source":"送行的群众B","status":"source"},"speaker:送行的群众C":{"text":"送行的群众C","source":"送行的群众C","status":"source"},"speaker:摩根":{"text":"Morgan","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"Merlin the First","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:那非":{"text":"Nazrik","source":"那非","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"Subtitles","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":30,"localized_text_count":25,"speaker_count":9}}